  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/679/236/menulogue_banner.png\" width=\"1100\" height=\"270\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/503/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish官方網站\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish的YouTube頻道\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish的Discord\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>📖 關於本模組：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Menulogue 是一個簡單的封裝模組，能讓 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a> 的設定入口點與 Fabric 版的 Catalogue 相容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">適用於 Minecraft 1.20.4 及以上版本，此模組需要從此處取得 Fabric 版的 Catalogue：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/502/908/icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/catalogue\" rel=\"nofollow\">Catalogue</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">適用於 Minecraft 1.20.3 及以下版本，此模組需要從此處取得 Fabric 版的 Catalogue：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/502/908/icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/catalogue-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Catalogue (Fabric)</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/502/822/menuloguescreenshot.png\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">🙋‍♀️ <strong>需要支援？加入官方 Discord 伺服器：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言區不適合提供技術支援，請加入官方 Discord 伺服器。您可以獲得安裝與設定模組的協助、解決崩潰問題等！此外，您還能搶先獲得模組更新與開發的最新消息（比其他地方都早）。</span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/794/808/img.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"28\"></span></a></p>",
